    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$1292.8\\text{ cm}^2$",
      "worked": "Exclude the open top. The base and four walls give\n$$\\begin{aligned}S&=25\\times18+2(25\\times9.8)+2(18\\times9.8)\\\\&=450+490+352.8\\\\&=1292.8\\text{ cm}^2.\\end{aligned}$$",
